Forward actual RegCreateKeyExA/W security descriptors and handle inheritance.
Intermediate routing/created parents retain default security; last actual components
(including trailing separators) get caller attributes. Preserve native checks/errors.
Native-Windows comparison remains a separate gate.

--- a/dlls/kernelbase/registry.c
+++ b/dlls/kernelbase/registry.c
@@ -358,13 +358,13 @@
 }
 
